WEBVTT

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.320
<i>Ready... 1, 2, 3, GO!</i>

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.160
<i>Love life! Very! Very! Happy!</i>

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.950
<i>Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping!</i>

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.660
<i>Adventure life! Heart-pounding, OK?</i>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.620
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:29.260
<i>Rushing out onto the road to</i>
<i>school with the blue sky behind us</i>

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.220
<i>I like that! I like this, too!</i>

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.720
<i>I'll take it all, all of it~</i>

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.600
<i>A girl who imagines love is all romance</i>

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:40.350
<i>If I can attack, I'll do it boldly</i>

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Let's find an original vision for the future</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.900
<i>Sometimes, we'll have a secret love advice time</i>

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:53.740
<i>Who do you like?</i>

00:00:53.950 --> 00:01:01.290
<i>You've got a green light for love now!</i>
<i>It's your chance to move forward!</i>

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.120
<i>So, let's just</i>

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Have a blast! Fall in love!</i>

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.210
<i>Our youth is non-stop!</i>

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.300
<i>Run! Aim for the future!</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.920
<i>Everyone gather</i>

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.800
<i>For a happy ending!</i>

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:16.340
<i>Will tomorrow be happy or sad?</i>
<i>Will we idle our time away?</i>

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.430
<i>We'll work hard!</i>

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:21.720
<i>I want to keep dreaming forever!</i>

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:24.940
<i>Let's fly out into the</i>
<i>world with all our strength!</i>

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:29.820
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.740
It's finally time for the
battle of the bands this weekend.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.870
Just because our opponents are
Plasmagica, whom we've beat before,

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.910
I don't think we can let our guard down.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.200
You're right.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:51.420
I mean, in battles, challengers usually
have the advantage over defending champions.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.880
Yeah, it's like while the
strawberry <i>daifuku</i> are defending,

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:58.470
the melon <i>daifuku</i> are attacking aggressively.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:00.470
Let's eat!

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:06.190
Yup, melon <i>daifuku</i> are yummier!

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:07.850
Right?

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.110
Hey, wait a minute!

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:14.570
Listening to you all talk, you all
sound negative, like you think we'll lose!

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:19.780
Well, we were just talking
about not being overconfident.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:28.580
No, don't do that! Stop!
If you do that, I'll dry out!

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.380
We can't win.

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:33.960
We definitely can't win...

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:36.880
We'll dry up and lose...

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:45.520
Don't do that, Rosia. If Jacklyn's skin
dries out, she becomes instantly depressed.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:49.100
Hmph, she was talking like
a loser before I dried her out.

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:53.770
But our opponents are sure
to be coming to win this time.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:56.280
The strawberry <i>daifuku</i>
isn't just sitting around, either.

00:02:56.490 --> 00:03:01.910
It's turned into a strawberry cream
<i>daifuku</i> to beat the melon <i>daifuku.</i>

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:03.490
It's delicious!

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:04.870
Yeah!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.410
That's right. That's why today,

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.790
we need to figure out what we
need to turn the tables on them—

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.170
No prob, no prob!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:18.510
I'll have everyone's eyes glued
to my shining light beam today, too!

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.470
There's no way we'll lose! No way!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:24.050
Y-You're right.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.110
Hey!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:39.280
Hey, are you listening? Hey!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:42.240
Oh, this is unusual.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.080
For <i>you</i> to want to talk to <i>me.</i>

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.450
Really?

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:52.170
Yeah. You seem to be at wits' end.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:56.130
Not really. I just have a little writer's block.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:59.670
I thought I'd talk to someone
for a change of pace.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:05.760
Writer's block, huh? So you've
finally decided to start working again?

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.270
How delightful to hear.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.850
I'm honored.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:17.610
Oh? What admirable words.
Shall I use more abusive language?

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:21.450
I thought you'd reply with your usual sarcasm.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:28.120
Being shut up in such a
small space is making me tired.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.710
How about it? Can't you let me out soon?

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.870
That's up to you.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.830
That's what I'd like to say, anyway.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:40.460
This battle of wills is
making me tired, as well.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:44.970
Oh? What are you trying to say?

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.970
The festival is drawing near.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:54.100
Bands who have gathered in
Midi City in pursuit of success or dreams

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.150
will battle it out here...

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:01.030
I have no better chance than this.

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.570
What are you trying to do?

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:08.450
I have told you many times of my dream.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:17.000
My first priority is to gather the talent
needed to stand at the top of this world.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.130
I wonder if they will gather for you...

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.720
It's hard to believe you're that popular.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.630
What are you saying?

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:27.720
It doesn't matter what they think.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:32.430
They will eventually have
no choice but to come to me.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:42.570
How was that?

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:45.450
I think it's getting better and better.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.030
This is a critical moment, pyuru!

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.540
We're going to be in
another battle of the bands!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:58.880
We'll be battling a band we
played against before, Plasmagica.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:02.340
Are you watching, Cyan?

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.340
Why me...?

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.890
Chuchu?

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:14.730
Is something wrong?

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:15.930
Yeah...

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:19.400
Could she be mad about something, pyuru?

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.030
Um, Chuchu...?

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.500
I've got it!

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:35.290
What?!

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.500
Pyuru?!

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:41.210
First of all, our playing is
perfected to a certain extent, right?

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.000
Y-Yeah...

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:46.420
And in terms of singing,
I think Cyan and my twin lead vocals

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:50.970
match pretty well with
Retoree and Moa backing us up!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.220
Yeah...

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.260
What's left is...

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.430
What, pyuru?

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.310
Our performance!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.150
- Performance?!
- Performance, pyuru?!

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:07.690
Without that, we cannot beat those girls!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:13.780
Um, what specifically do
you mean by "performance"?

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:17.620
Right, well I have a few ideas!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:18.960
Will you hear me out?

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.370
Y-Yeah.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.920
It sounds kind of fun, pyuru!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.340
Well, no matter what
direction they're going with this,

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:27.970
the girls are working hard, aren't they?

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.880
I'm impressed.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.430
Yes. However...

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:34.930
There are also more things to worry about.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.270
That's true...

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.520
Shall we seek the instruction of that personage?

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.900
Hmm, it's about time, isn't it?

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.990
One, two, three, go!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.400
Go!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:50.490
Listen.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:54.200
The winner of the battle of the bands is
decided not just by the fans at the concert,

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:57.700
but also by the votes of those watching online.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.250
Ouch...

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.260
This isn't working at all...

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.300
One, two, three, go!

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:14.850
- Pyururururu...!
- The winner is decided not just by how good a song is,

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:15.890
- but by how much you can charm the fans.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.560
- Yes!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.810
Cyan!

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:20.310
Okay!

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:28.530
Oi, you guys, how long are
you gonna take your time and—

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.860
Spin, spin, spin, spin...

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.740
What are you guys doing?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.540
Spin, spin, spin, meow...

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:51.380
Well, it's true that there's no point
if a band isn't showy or flowery.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:57.050
Which means, I am shouldering
that for all of SHINGANCRIMSONZ.

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:02.020
It's an Apocalypse where
I monopolize the gazes of all the cattle!

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:03.690
Fool.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:10.690
Well, it's true that the flower garden
in your head is full of insignificant flowers.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.780
Bastard, you want me to
break that flowery nose of yours?!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:17.410
Crow, even though it's flowery,
it's not a flower.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.790
It's a flowery and extreme misunderstanding.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:20.240
Hence—

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.410
Don't say that like you just made a great joke!

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:26.580
It doesn't matter, does it?

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:31.920
I'm saying, fans aren't so naïve as to
be moved by something so superficial.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.090
Huh?

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.590
Jeez, you'll never learn, will you?

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:41.640
Our mission is to speak directly to the souls
of the fans with our performances and songs.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:47.020
That is the combustion of
souls and what rock is, for real.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.060
Am I right?!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:54.650
You should just fight head-on
with all the soul in your own songs.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.360
Go, standing proud!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.370
As expected of a man with a full-time job.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:03.040
He brought everyone's hearts together
with his persuasive words. Hence—

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:07.330
Your lines always give me goose bumps...

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:11.840
Even this god must acknowledge those words...

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:15.760
All right! We'll do it today, too! We are—

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.800
SHINGANCRIMSONZ!

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:19.640
Huh?

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:20.890
They're gone!

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.600
Hence...

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:30.480
Um, sorry... I'm not very athletic...

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:34.030
I don't think it's a matter
of athletic ability anymore...

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.150
Pyuru...

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:39.360
Chuchu, are you okay?

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:44.410
"Superficial," huh? He sure didn't mince words.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.040
Chuchu.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:57.340
This is...

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:01.470
We have our own weapon. We have this!

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:07.060
Everyone has a great smile, pyuru!

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:10.230
Retoree, thanks.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:14.900
Let's perform our best and
make the best smiles bloom on stage!

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:15.940
Pyuru!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.490
Yeah!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:24.790
You're right. We must have
fun ourselves first, right?

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:35.090
I apologize for interrupting your practice.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:40.340
Don't worry about it. It was about
time for us to take a breather.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:44.220
My disciples need a break, too.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:48.060
I appreciate your words.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:52.230
Incidentally, what has brought you here?

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:55.320
The situation has become grave.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:12:00.450
I would like your counsel
regarding Grateful King.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.130
Now, for today's battle of the bands,

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.800
we have the band that appeared like
a comet and never lost their popularity—

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.760
Criticrista!

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:23.930
And the band that just
barely lost last time, Plasmagica!

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:27.310
They're back with a new song for their rematch!

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.900
Now, let us go!

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:39.230
Hey, Maple!

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.690
They have appeared!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.110
Did you come all this way to lose again?

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.410
You sure work hard.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.240
Is it okay for you to decide that?

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:50.910
It's already decided!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:55.500
In fact, there is no one who
can get in the way of these girls.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:58.210
Oh, you seem very confident.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.880
It's not confidence. It's results.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:05.930
Is that right? Is that right?

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.850
Everyone, let's go!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.740
We look forward to playing with you today.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.240
Cyan!

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:31.120
I feel so lucky to be able to see you again!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.960
Um... Uh...

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.830
I definitely won't lose.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.210
Huh?!

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:41.300
Just kidding! Let's all work hard today, okay?

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:43.630
Let's go, everyone!

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:57.310
Everyone, <i>we</i> will win this time!

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:58.940
Yeah!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.370
Hey, Mr. Berry!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.290
I wonder what happened...?

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:14.790
Is something wrong?

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:20.210
Yeah, I thought I'd get some advice from
him before the battle of the bands, but...

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:25.010
But I'm sure he's listening
to our performance, pyuru!

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:27.130
Yeah, you're right!

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:37.140
Now, it's finally time to start
the battle of the girl bands!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.820
With a major label debut
with Unicorn Virtual Music

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.650
and their entry in the rock festival decided—

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:50.160
It's the super popular band, Criticrista!

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.700
Good evening, everyone!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:57.620
Please cheer for me and
the rest of Cri-Cri today, too!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.170
- Rosia!
- Cri-Cri!

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:01.590
Here we go!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:01.840
One!

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:02.170
Two!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:02.460
Three!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:03.710
Four!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.930
♪ Thanks for waiting ♪

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:11.680
♪ It's SHOW TIME! ♪

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.510
♪ We'll perform in a cute way ♪

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:16.600
♪ We'll make your heart race ♪

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:17.310
♪ SHOW ROCK! ♪

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:17.430
What was with that
girl's attitude earlier, pyuru?
♪ SHOW ROCK! ♪

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:17.640
What was with that
girl's attitude earlier, pyuru?

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.520
♪ Eat up tonight, too ♪

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:19.730
What was with that
girl's attitude earlier, pyuru?

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:20.100
♪ That's right, I want to feel
you next to me more and more ♪

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:22.860
That little brat! I can't believe
she just hugged Cyan like that!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.360
♪ I'm sure, I'm sure our hearts will grow closer fast ♪

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.860
♪ Etched-in feelings that make my heart throb ♪

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.490
Chuchu, you're not going to watch?

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.610
♪ Yes! (Yes!) Yes! (Yes!) ♪

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:30.660
♪ They won't stop ♪

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.820
♪ More! Yeah! (Yeah!) Yeah! (Yeah!) ♪

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.740
Cyan!

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:38.910
I feel so lucky to be able to see you again!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.460
Um... Uh...

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:44.920
- Let's all work hard today, okay?
- Chuchu?

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.010
Chuchu!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:47.210
♪ We're caught up in it ♪

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:47.880
Um, right!

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:48.260
♪ Rushing all over the world ♪

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.590
What's wrong?

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:49.800
♪ Rushing all over the world ♪

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:50.720
It's almost our turn.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.760
It's not like you to
stare off into space, pyuru!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:53.970
♪ Resounding no matter when, forever ♪

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:55.720
Focus, focus!

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:55.930
♪ Resounding no matter when, forever ♪

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:56.680
R-Right, I know.

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:59.060
♪ These feelings won't stop ♪

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.480
♪ Yay! ♪

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.860
We did our cutest best today, too!

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:08.690
Everyone, you'll all vote for us, right?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:12.070
If you don't, I won't forgive you!

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:15.660
- Yay!
- I'll definitely vote for you!
- Rosia!

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.580
Will they get their revenge?

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:20.620
Their entry to the rock festival is
riding on this important performance!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:24.460
From Banded Rocking Records, it's Plasmagica!

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:36.050
Now, everyone! Let's go!

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.730
With our best performance...

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.150
...to make the best smiles!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:47.690
Ready, go! Yay!

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:58.280
♪ Falling star of dreams shining in the night sky ♪

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:06.290
♪ Watching it, singing,
letting it carry these feelings ♪

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:29.730
♪ Counting the lights ♪

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:32.570
♪ Of the stars quietly ♪

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:38.030
♪ Hiding my sorrow ♪

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.700
♪ Have you noticed? ♪

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:43.250
♪ Just thinking about you ♪

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:47.750
♪ Makes my heart hurt ♪

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.710
♪ I can't sleep ♪

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.550
♪ Nights like this ♪

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:55.010
♪ Oh, just let me ♪

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:58.930
♪ Have one wish ♪

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:04.230
♪ Falling star of dreams shining in the night sky ♪

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:09.520
♪ I want to see it from the same place as you ♪

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:13.230
♪ No matter how far apart we are ♪

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:21.330
♪ Our hearts will one day become one ♪

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.460
No way... no way...

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.590
Rosia? Are you all right?

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.930
What's wrong?

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:46.100
Y-You can't tell...? Everyone...

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:54.730
W-We... to Plasmagica... to that Cyan...

00:18:56.320 --> 00:19:00.700
Okay, everyone! Which of these
two girl bands was more awesome?

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:03.490
Keep those votes coming!

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.580
Wasn't that fun?

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:09.000
I feel like that was the
best performance we've ever done!

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:10.460
I do, too!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.250
Me too, pyuru!

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:15.960
Now, we'll have nothing left
to say as long as we get results!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:22.140
What are the results? Who will be the winner?!

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:26.980
Winner! Plasmagica!

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:30.480
They overturned speculation
and got their revenge!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:32.190
Yay!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.650
We did it!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.480
We won, pyuru!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.360
Yeah, yeah...!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.740
Everyone... I'm so glad!

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:42.280
Cyan, your singing voice was cute!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:43.280
Really?

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:46.450
Having you and Chuchu as
twin lead vocals was a success, pyuru!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.000
Yes, it was!

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:07.180
What's wrong? You all seem down.

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:11.060
Isn't it fine since you can
be in the festival already?

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:13.310
It doesn't matter if you lose to them once—

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:15.190
It's <i>not</i> fine!

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:25.910
No matter what... we...
Criticrista... can't lose...

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.080
She's right.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:38.710
D-Dagger, sir, um, why—

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:48.770
Goodbye, Ogasawara.
I don't ever want to see your face again.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:52.810
Disappear from my sight this instant.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.030
Now...

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.160
You girls...

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:13.290
Do you understand what it means to lose?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:19.000
You're wretched... unsightly...
pathetic, and a disgrace...

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:25.590
In fact, there's no reason
to have signed you at all...

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:35.060
Incompetent... complete trash!

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:37.940
Scum!

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:47.370
Goodbye to you all, too!

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:04.050
<i>If you like it, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:06.930
<i>You can do it because you like it</i>

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:09.640
<i>The feeling that you like music</i>

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:13.020
<i>Can't be stopped by anyone</i>

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:21.440
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:23.650
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:27.200
<i>Running through my body</i>

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:29.740
<i>This electric thrill</i>

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:34.750
<i>Is this feeling curiosity?</i>

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:38.290
<i>Negativity is a decrescendo</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:40.960
<i>Hope and expectations, a crescendo</i>

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:46.510
<i>Show off our passion and</i>
<i>get god to be our ally, too</i>

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:52.010
<i>I wanna share with everyone and have a taste of</i>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:55.730
<i>Big!! Rocking!! Heart-throbbing!! Happiness!!!!</i>

00:22:56.730 --> 00:22:59.770
<i>If it's you, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.770
<i>You can do it because it's you</i>

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:07.860
<i>Let's try performing these</i>
<i>dream-colored notes together</i>

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:11.070
<i>I want to tell you directly</i>

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:13.910
<i>A life-sized, "heart-sized" heart</i>

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:16.790
<i>In order for it to reach you...</i>

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:20.120
<i>I will sing with all I have</i>

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:22.880
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:24.840
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:28.380
Here's Master Darudayu!

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:31.140
Does a high-ranking <i>daruma</i>
like you have any desires?

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:35.770
Well... I suppose it is for this
world to be filled with happy music.

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:37.810
Your face also resembles a lucky cat.

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:38.850
Really?

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:40.600
Miss Dayu...!
